{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cza94vmx","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":41.33,"top":176.89,"width":581.33,"height":183.11},"name":"Google Shape;534;p58","text":"Un dominio exigente\nCada informe combina hechos, contextos, unidades y dimensiones. Las taxonomías definen conceptos, relaciones y restricciones que el editor debe respetar.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Inter","color":"#FFFFFF","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/d0jax03i","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":41.33,"top":404.81,"width":581.33,"height":183.11},"name":"Google Shape;534;p58","text":"Una herramienta integrada\nEl proyecto reúne la carga de taxonomías, la edición de instancias y la validación en una aplicación orientada al Banco de España.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Inter","color":"#FFFFFF","alignment":"left"}}
